## 5. Security & RBAC Governance (Jean-Luc Protocol)

The entire portal is encapsulated within a secure `AuthContext` and `<ProtectedRoute>` router hierarchy.

**Features**: Mock Personnel Login dropdown (CEO, Deputy CEO, Project Manager, Engineer) • True conditional rendering based on authentication state • Dynamic user profiles in the navigation sidebar.

---

## 6. Report "Nuke" Engine

A client-side PDF generation script integrated exclusively into the CEO Dashboard. It empowers executives to export real-time intelligence offline for stakeholder meetings.

**Features**: `jsPDF` and `autoTable` generation • Dynamic styling mapping project health states (e.g., Red text for CRITICAL projects) • Strict RBAC restriction (button only appears for CEO/Deputy CEO roles).

